    0. SplashActivity
    1. NewUserActivity - 3 Fragments
    2. HomeActivity
    3. ScheduleActivity
    4. MedicinesActivity
    5. MenuActivity


    1. Profile Dialog
    2. NotifStatus Dialog
    3. Export Dialog

    Add Medicine
    Edit Medicine

    ManageProfile
    SwitchProfile

    Preferences
    Emergency
    HelpSupport


    -->